data: {"id": "9bb53681c726499e-thinking-parallel_evidence-1836", "run_id": "9bb53681c726499e", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "# 证据结论\n\n## 实体身份\n- Pod: `aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-nqrzv`\n- UID: `7f78dcbf-0a84-437d-b1c1-e376d407c9c0`\n- Node: `node2`, IP: `172.16.104.14`\n- 容器: `app` (image: `registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing`, pullPolicy: Always)\n- 无 imagePullSecrets\n\n## 支持 ImagePullFailed 根因的事实\n\n1. **Kubernetes Events 明确指出 DNS 解析失败**：\n   - `Head \"https://registry.invalid/v2/aiops/workload/manifests/missing\": dial tcp: lookup registry.invalid on 127.0.0.53:53: no such host`\n   - 这是**DNS 解析失败导致镜像仓库不可达**的典型表现\n\n2.", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788767881106, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

